WEBVTT

00:00:06.813 --> 00:00:08.013
(PHONE RINGING)

00:00:09.613 --> 00:00:11.253
Oh, no! It's Mom again! What do we do?

00:00:11.333 --> 00:00:12.333
(ANGER GRUNTS)

00:00:15.093 --> 00:00:16.133
(RINGING STOPS)

00:00:18.053 --> 00:00:20.333
This is madness!
She shouldn't run away!

00:00:20.413 --> 00:00:22.373
Let's get this idea
out of her head. (STRAINING)

00:00:22.853 --> 00:00:23.853
Sadness?

00:00:24.333 --> 00:00:26.253
(GASPS) Sadness!

00:00:27.213 --> 00:00:28.213
Joy?

00:00:29.093 --> 00:00:30.493
Wait! Sadness!

00:00:30.853 --> 00:00:34.693
Just let me go!
Riley's better off without me!

00:00:34.893 --> 00:00:35.773
JOY: Come back!

00:00:41.213 --> 00:00:42.773
Okay, you're saying your husband

00:00:42.853 --> 00:00:44.533
was blown away by an elephant.

00:00:44.773 --> 00:00:45.813
Was he with anyone?

00:00:45.893 --> 00:00:47.213
Yes! And there she is!

00:00:47.453 --> 00:00:48.733
Hey! Come back here!

00:00:48.853 --> 00:00:50.973
Forget it, Jake. It's Cloud Town.

00:00:54.053 --> 00:00:56.453
Oh! What? Sadness!

00:00:56.533 --> 00:00:59.493
(SOBBING) I only make
everything worse!

00:00:59.573 --> 00:01:01.813
Wait! Sadness!
We got to get you back to...

00:01:01.973 --> 00:01:03.053
(RUMBLING)

00:01:12.053 --> 00:01:13.693
-It's stuck!
-Oh, great.

00:01:13.773 --> 00:01:15.533
-What do you mean it's stuck?
-Now what?

00:01:15.773 --> 00:01:17.773
Oh, no no no no! What is this?

00:01:20.053 --> 00:01:21.133
(GRUNTS)

00:01:26.893 --> 00:01:28.253
-How do we stop it?
-I got it!

00:01:28.413 --> 00:01:30.333
Make her feel scared!
That'll make her change her mind!

00:01:30.413 --> 00:01:32.213
-Brilliant!
-DISGUST: I know it's brilliant! Do it!

00:01:32.333 --> 00:01:34.413
Ah! Nothing's working!
Why isn't it working?

00:01:34.493 --> 00:01:35.733
-Let me try.
-Great! You broke it!

00:01:35.813 --> 00:01:36.893
-No, I didn't! Don't touch that!
-(ARGUING)

00:01:36.973 --> 00:01:38.133
-Let me do it! Get out of here!
-(ALL GRUNTING)

00:01:42.173 --> 00:01:45.053
Guys, we can't make Riley feel anything.

00:01:46.853 --> 00:01:48.133
What have we done?

00:01:49.053 --> 00:01:50.573
Hey! Hey, look at me!

00:01:50.693 --> 00:01:52.053
Did you mean what you said before?

00:01:52.133 --> 00:01:54.413
I would die for Riley!
I would die for Riley!

00:01:54.573 --> 00:01:56.213
Yeah, okay, haircut. Time to prove it.

00:01:57.293 --> 00:01:58.453
(BEEPING RAPIDLY)

00:02:00.013 --> 00:02:01.893
I would die for Riley!
I would die for Riley!

00:02:01.973 --> 00:02:04.453
I would die for Riley!

00:02:06.373 --> 00:02:07.573
(WAILING)

00:02:20.413 --> 00:02:21.973
That's it! I fold!

00:02:39.733 --> 00:02:40.733
Whoa!

00:02:40.813 --> 00:02:42.653
Whoa.

00:02:44.093 --> 00:02:45.093
Whoa!

00:02:45.173 --> 00:02:46.693
IMAGINARY BOYFRIENDS: Whoa!

00:02:52.973 --> 00:02:56.893
This is crazy. This is crazy.
No, no, no. Joy. Be positive.

00:03:00.333 --> 00:03:02.253
I am positive this is crazy!

00:03:06.853 --> 00:03:09.373
-Now!
-IMAGINARY BOYFRIENDS: For Riley!

00:03:17.213 --> 00:03:18.853
-Joy?
-Hang on!

00:03:20.413 --> 00:03:22.333
Oh, I wish Joy was here!

00:03:29.613 --> 00:03:30.773
It's Joy!

00:03:31.533 --> 00:03:32.733
ANGER: Stand back!

00:03:34.013 --> 00:03:35.053
That worked.

00:03:35.173 --> 00:03:37.293
Well, what would you do,
if you're so smart?

00:03:37.733 --> 00:03:40.413
I'd tell you,
but you're too dumb to understand.

00:03:40.533 --> 00:03:43.253
-What?
-Of course your tiny brain is confused.

00:03:43.373 --> 00:03:45.893
Guess I'll just have to
dumb it down to your level.

00:03:46.333 --> 00:03:48.293
Sorry I don't speak moron
as well as you,

00:03:48.373 --> 00:03:50.373
but let me try. Duh!

00:03:51.053 --> 00:03:52.293
(SCREAMS)

00:04:00.173 --> 00:04:01.493
FEAR: Oh, thank goodness you're back!

00:04:01.573 --> 00:04:03.493
-Things are really messed up!
-We found this idea.

00:04:03.573 --> 00:04:05.573
We were just trying to
make happy memories. We were just trying to
make happy memories.

00:04:15.373 --> 00:04:16.813
Joy, you got to fix this! Get up there!

00:04:16.893 --> 00:04:18.573
Sadness, it's up to you.

00:04:18.693 --> 00:04:20.573
-Me?
-ALL: Sadness?

00:04:21.053 --> 00:04:22.133
I can't, Joy.

00:04:22.253 --> 00:04:24.933
Yes, you can. Riley needs you.

00:04:36.933 --> 00:04:38.093
Okay.

00:04:58.613 --> 00:05:01.253
Wait! Stop! I want to get off!

00:05:01.733 --> 00:05:02.813
(BRAKES SCREECH)

00:05:12.973 --> 00:05:14.733
All right. Thank you. We will.

00:05:14.813 --> 00:05:17.053
Her teacher hasn't even
seen Riley all day.

00:05:17.133 --> 00:05:18.293
-What?
-What was she wearing last?

00:05:18.373 --> 00:05:19.773
-Do you even remember what...
-I can't believe this.

00:05:20.613 --> 00:05:21.733
DAD: Riley, there you are!
Thank goodness!

00:05:21.813 --> 00:05:22.973
MOM: We were worried sick!

00:05:23.053 --> 00:05:24.493
Where have you been? It's so late!

00:05:24.613 --> 00:05:26.613
DAD: Oh, honey!
What happened? Are you all right?

00:05:26.693 --> 00:05:28.653
MOM: We asked the neighbors,
I called the school,

00:05:28.813 --> 00:05:30.133
we talked to your teacher.

00:06:14.933 --> 00:06:16.453
(GIGGLING)

